(7682918, 1257572, 150202, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I love it.  <br/> <br/>I would be curious if it would look better with less of a blue cast on the backside of the mountain and if the brush in the foreground on the right wasn''t there.  A very nice scene.</td>', 'Beautiful!  I love it.   I would be curious if it would look better with less of a blue cast on the backside of the mountain and if the brush in the foreground on the right wasn''t there.  A very nice scene.', '2020-12-31 15:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682919, 1257592, 150202, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  I might soften or warm the colors a bit, seems a bit harsh.</td>', 'Good composition.  I might soften or warm the colors a bit, seems a bit harsh.', '2020-12-31 15:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682920, 1257607, 150202, '<td valign="top">I really love this one!  Especially how you used the year within the hour glass.  The soft background is nice with a good sentiment in front.  The dove and the tree tie it all together.  I might have moved the hour glass over just a smidge to see if I like that better.</td>', 'I really love this one!  Especially how you used the year within the hour glass.  The soft background is nice with a good sentiment in front.  The dove and the tree tie it all together.  I might have moved the hour glass over just a smidge to see if I like that better.', '2020-12-31 15:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682921, 1257465, 150202, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the holidays.  I like how you have taken this busy scene and applied some affects.  It makes the tree stand out nicely.  The only thing I might try to do different is the spacing of season''s greetings.  Since greetings is longer it looks slightly unbalanced. Maybe try reducing the spacing in greetings to see if that helps.</td>', 'Interesting take on the holidays.  I like how you have taken this busy scene and applied some affects.  It makes the tree stand out nicely.  The only thing I might try to do different is the spacing of season''s greetings.  Since greetings is longer it looks slightly unbalanced. Maybe try reducing the spacing in greetings to see if that helps.', '2020-12-31 15:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682922, 1257325, 150202, '<td valign="top">The Santa hat on the Buddha is great.  There is a little too much going on in this photo for me.  If you had replaced the background with something more calming, a field of evergreen, bamboo or blurry lights, that would have helped.</td>', 'The Santa hat on the Buddha is great.  There is a little too much going on in this photo for me.  If you had replaced the background with something more calming, a field of evergreen, bamboo or blurry lights, that would have helped.', '2020-12-31 15:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682923, 1257472, 150202, '<td valign="top">Nice fun photo!  Good clear capture of the house.  I''m not loving the large plain border on this one though, leaves me wanting for more but I''m not sure what.  The helicopter santa is a nice touch!</td>', 'Nice fun photo!  Good clear capture of the house.  I''m not loving the large plain border on this one though, leaves me wanting for more but I''m not sure what.  The helicopter santa is a nice touch!', '2020-12-31 15:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682924, 1257264, 150202, '<td valign="top">Cute bears!  This photo lacks a feeling of motion, maybe a different angle would have helped.  I like the background you have, plain grey with reflections of the lights works really well to bring a calmness to the photo.</td>', 'Cute bears!  This photo lacks a feeling of motion, maybe a different angle would have helped.  I like the background you have, plain grey with reflections of the lights works really well to bring a calmness to the photo.', '2020-12-31 15:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682925, 1257527, 150202, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, the colors are beautiful.  The sky looks so serene.  The horizon doesn''t look straight to me, which bothers my OCD, lol.  I''d also like if the Happy New Year and Believe in New Beginnings phrases were in a different font or size to emphasize the two separate phrases. I like the starburst affect on the sun.</td>', 'I like this photo, the colors are beautiful.  The sky looks so serene.  The horizon doesn''t look straight to me, which bothers my OCD, lol.  I''d also like if the Happy New Year and Believe in New Beginnings phrases were in a different font or size to emphasize the two separate phrases. I like the starburst affect on the sun.', '2020-12-31 15:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682926, 1257561, 150202, '<td valign="top">Impressive photo with all that white!  Hard to do this well.  The text doesn''t quite do it for me.  I think maybe it looks like more of a sentence than a greeting.  Perhaps more capitalization, or a carriage return after happy and peaceful.  I like the "hint" of the drink in the background, that really makes this photo complete.  Nice job.</td>', 'Impressive photo with all that white!  Hard to do this well.  The text doesn''t quite do it for me.  I think maybe it looks like more of a sentence than a greeting.  Perhaps more capitalization, or a carriage return after happy and peaceful.  I like the "hint" of the drink in the background, that really makes this photo complete.  Nice job.', '2020-12-31 15:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682927, 1257611, 150202, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, I like the contemplative feel.  I''m not a fan of the font you used personally.  I like the colors and the softness.  Kudos.</td>', 'Nice photo, I like the contemplative feel.  I''m not a fan of the font you used personally.  I like the colors and the softness.  Kudos.', '2020-12-31 15:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682928, 1257337, 150202, '<td valign="top">I like the fading of the black on the borders.  The "HOPE" seems a little to bright to me.  Nice beautiful composition.</td>', 'I like the fading of the black on the borders.  The "HOPE" seems a little to bright to me.  Nice beautiful composition.', '2020-12-31 15:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682929, 1257593, 150202, '<td valign="top">I like the concept you put together.  The flowers just seem a little out of focus to me and seem to contrast with the more "fun" text.  I like the nice background and the phone way you did the M.</td>', 'I like the concept you put together.  The flowers just seem a little out of focus to me and seem to contrast with the more "fun" text.  I like the nice background and the phone way you did the M.', '2020-12-31 15:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682930, 1257586, 150202, '<td valign="top">This is so interesting.  The only thing I''m not keen on are the fact that the start and ending word is cut off.  I really like the colors blending all together.  The modern in the oper left with the "old time" photos on the bottom.  Nice job!</td>', 'This is so interesting.  The only thing I''m not keen on are the fact that the start and ending word is cut off.  I really like the colors blending all together.  The modern in the oper left with the "old time" photos on the bottom.  Nice job!', '2020-12-31 15:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682931, 1257614, 150202, '<td valign="top">I like the big fluffy tree.  I find the background distracting and the bright white lights a little harsh.  Good exposure and focus.</td>', 'I like the big fluffy tree.  I find the background distracting and the bright white lights a little harsh.  Good exposure and focus.', '2020-12-31 15:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682932, 1257461, 150202, '<td valign="top">So cute!  Love this.  My only comment would be that the shadows in the background, especially above their heads I find a bit distracting.  Not sure how to avoid that.  Super cute and could definitely find itself in the greeting card aisle!</td>', 'So cute!  Love this.  My only comment would be that the shadows in the background, especially above their heads I find a bit distracting.  Not sure how to avoid that.  Super cute and could definitely find itself in the greeting card aisle!', '2020-12-31 15:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682933, 1257521, 150202, '<td valign="top">Love it!  Perfect concept for this year!  Pretty lights, in focus and good exposure.  I find myself wanting something more, I''m not sure what.  Nice job!</td>', 'Love it!  Perfect concept for this year!  Pretty lights, in focus and good exposure.  I find myself wanting something more, I''m not sure what.  Nice job!', '2020-12-31 15:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682934, 1257511, 150202, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, very funny!  I would have tried blending the blue background into the black table maybe.  Or perhaps tried a different New Year text color or style.  Overall this is a well exposed photo with a bit of humor, good job.</td>', 'Cute idea, very funny!  I would have tried blending the blue background into the black table maybe.  Or perhaps tried a different New Year text color or style.  Overall this is a well exposed photo with a bit of humor, good job.', '2020-12-31 16:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682935, 1257591, 150202, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph.  Makes me feel serene and relaxed.  The clouds are great.  Awesome.</td>', 'Beautiful photograph.  Makes me feel serene and relaxed.  The clouds are great.  Awesome.', '2020-12-31 16:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682936, 1257494, 150202, '<td valign="top">Amazing!  I love the "space effect" style of the background coupled with the nice scene in the foreground with the footprints going off.  I''d move the starburst down a bit, or maybe to a more distant tree.  Really great photo that captures the magical season.</td>', 'Amazing!  I love the "space effect" style of the background coupled with the nice scene in the foreground with the footprints going off.  I''d move the starburst down a bit, or maybe to a more distant tree.  Really great photo that captures the magical season.', '2020-12-31 16:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682937, 1257606, 150202, '<td valign="top">Well composed photo, makes you decipher the title.  If you could use a higher aperture and make the sun look more like a starburst it would have been even better.  That and clone out the orange barrel.  I like how the foreground is nice and crisp.</td>', 'Well composed photo, makes you decipher the title.  If you could use a higher aperture and make the sun look more like a starburst it would have been even better.  That and clone out the orange barrel.  I like how the foreground is nice and crisp.', '2020-12-31 16:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682938, 1257597, 150202, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.  I like the softness and the feeling of blue throughout the entire photo.  The starbursts are nice too.</td>', 'Beautiful composition.  I like the softness and the feeling of blue throughout the entire photo.  The starbursts are nice too.', '2020-12-31 16:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682939, 1257601, 150202, '<td valign="top">Dogs!  What''s not to love.  Fun concept, in focus and well composed.  Nice job.</td>', 'Dogs!  What''s not to love.  Fun concept, in focus and well composed.  Nice job.', '2020-12-31 16:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682940, 1257407, 150202, '<td valign="top">Good photo with everything well in focus.  My eye isn''t sure what to focus on since there is so much going on.  Nice colors!</td>', 'Good photo with everything well in focus.  My eye isn''t sure what to focus on since there is so much going on.  Nice colors!', '2020-12-31 16:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682941, 1257546, 150202, '<td valign="top">I like this concept, very clever!  I think something simpler for the added greeting might have been better since you already have to read the fortune.  I like the gently blurred background too!</td>', 'I like this concept, very clever!  I think something simpler for the added greeting might have been better since you already have to read the fortune.  I like the gently blurred background too!', '2020-12-31 16:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
