(7682943, 1257598, 150202, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Interesting to have both the moon and the sun in the same photo, with a message we all can relate to.  I think I might have preferred a more crisp star field, or more plentiful, or something.  I really liked the photo within the hope and the moon just looks great.  Love it.</td>', 'I like this.  Interesting to have both the moon and the sun in the same photo, with a message we all can relate to.  I think I might have preferred a more crisp star field, or more plentiful, or something.  I really liked the photo within the hope and the moon just looks great.  Love it.', '2020-12-31 16:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7682944, 1257463, 150202, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.  The background seems to blend too well with the foreground for some reason.  The foreground colors and sharpness a great.</td>', 'I like the composition.  The background seems to blend too well with the foreground for some reason.  The foreground colors and sharpness a great.', '2020-12-31 16:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
